# The .cmd scripts must stay CRLF and must NOT gain a UTF-8 BOM: cmd mis-parses
# a batch file whose first bytes are the BOM ("n++@echo off"). They are ASCII on
# purpose - Persian text reaches them through a UTF-8 file or chcp 65001.
*.cmd   text eol=crlf working-tree-encoding=ISO-8859-1
*.S     text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
